ic for eczema in a high-friction, moisture-retentive area. The guidelines [2] do not provide specific criteria, but the handbook [5] supports the diagnosis of eczema based on morphology and location. Therefore, despite the model’s lower probability, the visual and clinical features strongly support eczema as the most likely diagnosis.'}
